# Architecture

## Dependency direction

```
presentation → data
```

- Data: entities/models under `data/models/`, data sources, abstract repository + `RepositoryImpl`.
- Presentation: pages, widgets, Cubit + state (ViewModel).
- Cubit depends on the abstract repository only — no domain or use-case layer.
- Shared cross-feature code lives in `lib/shared/` and `lib/core/`.

## Feature layout (follow `home`)

```
features/<feature>/
├── data/datasources/   *_remote_data_source.dart [, *_local_data_source.dart]
├── data/models/        *_entity.dart (Equatable; Hive OK when following home), *_model.dart (extends entity; manual fromJson/toJson)
├── data/repositories/  *_repository.dart (abstract), *_repository_impl.dart
├── presentation/manager/<entity>/  *_cubit.dart, *_state.dart
├── presentation/pages/ *_page.dart
├── presentation/widgets/
└── <feature>_injection.dart
```

## Data flow

`UI → Cubit → Repository → DataSource → Either<Failure, T> → emit State`

## Allowed / forbidden imports

| Layer | Allowed | Forbidden |
|-------|---------|-----------|
| data | entities/models, Dio/ApiConsumer, Hive, storage, Failure/dartz | flutter_bloc, widgets |
| presentation | abstract repositories, entities, flutter_bloc, UI | Dio, Hive, data sources directly |

## Adding a feature

1. Ask approval, then `mason make feature --feature_name order --entity_name Order`
2. Endpoint in `lib/core/constants/api_endpoints.dart`
3. `initOrder()` in `lib/core/di/injection_container.dart`
4. Route in `lib/config/routing/app_router.dart` + `route_names.dart`
5. Wire DI: `registerLazySingleton` for repos/DS; `registerFactory` for cubits

## Known deviations (do not copy for new API features)

- `cart` / `profile`: stubs — incomplete wiring.
- `theme`: local prefs without Either — acceptable only for simple local preferences.
